    "details": {
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p><strong>Concept.</strong> A techno-Viking barge that traded its sail for a P.A. system and its figurehead for a battle-cradle. It sings as it rams. The Valhaulans insist the song is soothing; the wreckage disagrees.</p>\n<p><strong>Signature.</strong> A drum the size of an argument and a muster-lullaby loud enough to curdle morale three hexes out. Not to be confused with the flagship Valhauler — this is the one they actually fight in.</p>",
        "public": ""
      }
    },
